    },
    {
      "text": "19th century Russia loved it so much they called it Russian gold.",
      "say": "Nineteenth century Russia loved it so much they called it Russian gold.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "Russian\ngold",
        "sub": "1800s"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "White gold mixes in palladium or nickel, then gets a rhodium coat.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "matthew-front-white-render.webp",
        "label": "White gold"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "That coat wears thin on a ring worn every day,",
